{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44970","headline":"酬李司直纵诸公冬日游妙喜寺题照昱二上人房寄长城潘丞述 · 皎然","name":"酬李司直纵诸公冬日游妙喜寺题照昱二上人房寄长城潘丞述","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"达贤贵贞隐，常惧迹不灭。\n遂与永公期，遗身坐林樾。\n华轩何辚辚，爲我到幽绝。\n心境寒草花，空门青山月。\n潘生独不见，清景屡盈缺。\n林下常寂寥，人间自离别。\n何时解轻佩，来税丘中辙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44970.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44970","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}